old and IT gadget products. In addition, the company operates e-commerce platform, redemption programs, and solar panels; deals in electric vehicles, electric charging stations, and other related accessories; distributes household and IT gadget products; offers telecommunication services; and importers and exporters of electrical items, household appliances, kitchen utensils, household hardware and IT gadget products. The company was founded in 1989 and is headquartered in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia. Senheng New Retail Berhad operates as a subsidiary of Sq Digital Sdn. Bhd.","zh":"Senheng New Retail Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚经营消费电子电器连锁零售业务。公司成立于1989年，总部位于吉隆坡，是Sq Digital Sdn. Bhd.的子公司。","lines":["零售业务：通过整合的全渠道平台提供数码产品、生活电子产品、家用电器及其他商品，客户为马来西亚消费者。","智能解决方案：提供智能家居等解决方案，面向消费者。","保修服务：提供自保保险服务，客户为购买产品的消费者。","电子商务与兑换计划：运营电商平台和兑换计划，面向线上消费者。","太阳能与电动车相关：经营太阳能板、电动车、充电站及相关配件，客户为相关产品用户。","分销与贸易：分销家用和IT产品，并从事电器、家居用品等的进出口，客户包括零售商和商业客户。"],"lines_en":["Retail: Offers digital gadgets, lifestyle electronics, home appliances, and other merchandise through an integrated omnichannel platform to Malaysian consumers.","Smart Solutions: Provides smart solutions to consumers.","Warranty Services: Offers captive insurance services to consumers who purchase products.","E-commerce and Redemption Programs: Operates e-commerce platform and redemption programs for online consumers.","Solar and EV-related: Deals in solar panels, electric vehicles, charging stations, and related accessories for relevant users.","Distribution and Trading: Distributes household and IT products and imports/exports electrical items, household appliances, and kitchen utensils to retailers and business customers."]}}